global decDate, klar

on exitFrame
  [  0] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  1] setglobal 35 ............................ klar = 0
  [  3] pushint8 22 ............................. <22>
  [  5] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [  6] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [  8] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 22 to 0
  [ 10] pushint8 23 ............................. <23>
  [ 12] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 13] pushint8 25 ............................. <25>
  [ 15] set 6 ................................... set the visible of sprite 23 to 0
  [ 17] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 19] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 21] get 4 ................................... <the volume of sound 2>
  [ 23] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = the volume of sound 2
  [ 25] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 27] pushint8 100 ............................ <100>
  [ 29] lt ...................................... <volym < 100>
  [ 30] jmpifz [ 60] ............................ repeat while volym < 100
  [ 33] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 35] pushint8 10 ............................. <10>
  [ 37] add ..................................... <volym + 10>
  [ 38] setlocal 0 .............................. volym = volym + 10
  [ 40] pushint8 2 .............................. <2>
  [ 42] getlocal 0 .............................. <volym>
  [ 44] pusharglist 1 ........................... <volym>
  [ 46] extcall 39 .............................. <integer(volym)>
  [ 48] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 50] set 4 ................................... set the volume of sound 2 to integer(volym)
  [ 52] pushint8 6 .............................. <6>
  [ 54] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <6>
  [ 56] extcall 43 .............................. Wait(6)
  [ 58] endrepeat [ 25]
  [ 60] pushint8 9 .............................. <9>
  [ 62] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <9>
  [ 64] extcall 25 .............................. puppetTransition(9)
  [ 66] pushcons 0 .............................. <"rim.aif">
  [ 68] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"rim.aif">
  [ 70] extcall 36 .............................. puppetSound("rim.aif")
  [ 72] pushcons 8 .............................. <"dikt">
  [ 74] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <"dikt">
  [ 76] extcall 12 .............................. go("dikt")
  [ 78] ret
end
